Official website for **KEGNA Engineering Group** – your trusted partner in import, export, and industrial engineering solutions.

## ✨ Features

- 🎨 **Modern & Clean Design** – Professional layout with greenish and blue color scheme
- 🌙 **Dark/Light Mode** – Seamless theme switching with saved preferences
- 📱 **Fully Responsive** – Works perfectly on mobile, tablet, and desktop
- ⚙️ **Animated Gears** – Engaging logo animation that reflects engineering identity
- 🗺️ **Google Maps Integration** – Shows company location (Bole, Addis Ababa)
- 🧭 **Smooth Navigation** – Hamburger menu on mobile with smooth scroll to sections
- 🎯 **Service Showcase** – Clear presentation of Import, Export, and Engineering services
- 📊 **Projects Section** – Highlights completed and ongoing industrial projects

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **HTML5** – Semantic structure
- **CSS3** – Custom properties, Flexbox, Grid, animations
- **JavaScript** – Dark mode toggle, mobile menu, smooth scroll
- **Font Awesome 6** – Icons and gear animations
- **Google Maps Embed API** – Location display

